{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act46side_level_act46side_01_beg","storyGroup":"act46side","storySort":2,"storyDependence":"act46side_level_act46side_st01","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"OS-1","storyName":"呼号声中","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"天灾发生后，三大家族立刻开始了救援工作。但是天灾带来的恐慌还是在人群中蔓延开来。就在这个时候，恩雅发现雅儿失踪了。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act46side/level_act46side_01_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act46side_01","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":0,"next":2,"characters":["角峰","救援队员A","救援队员B","众救援队员","救援队员","阿克托斯","受伤的男人","罗德岛医疗干员","调查队员","恩希欧迪斯","喀兰贸易文员","锏","恩雅","年长的修士","激动的修士","两位修士","蔓珠院长老","阿德颂","大长老"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness02_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness02_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crowdtalk_fear","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":7},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.8","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":8},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_199_yak_1#6$1","duration":"0.7","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_199_yak_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"一队，把物资放到东边的空地。","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ec/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"配合佩尔罗契的增援一起搭建医疗帐篷，准备接收伤员！","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ec/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":16},{"type":"charslot","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"救援队员A","text":"明白！","id":18},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_199_yak_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"二队，带上雪铲和酒袋，继续在火车站那边的废墟寻找幸存者。仔细搜，不要漏听呼救声。","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ec/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":21},{"type":"charslot","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"救援队员B","text":"明白！大家伙，带上东西跟我走——","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_199_yak_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"切记不要发出太大的声音，山上的情况还不清楚，不排除还有发生二次雪崩的可能。探查情况的小队已经在去往山顶的路上了。","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ec/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_199_yak_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"相信我们的同伴，相信耶拉冈德正在庇佑着谢拉格人。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":28},{"type":"charslot","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"救援队员B","text":"耶拉冈德在上。","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"救援队员A","text":"......耶拉冈德在上。","id":31},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_199_yak_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"耶拉冈德在上。","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ec/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_199_yak_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"时间不等人，立刻开始行动吧。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":36},{"type":"charslot","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"众救援队员","text":"是！","id":38},{"type":"dialog","id":39},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":40},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowcrwdmarch","volume":"1","id":41},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":42},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":43},{"type":"text","text":"交叠在一起的回答声还未从冷风中散去，希瓦艾什家的侍从已经在雪地上散开，奔向各个方向。","id":44},{"type":"text","text":"在这里的不只有他们，这场白色的崩溃显然在祥和的日子里造成了一片清晰的创口。","id":45},{"type":"dialog","id":46},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":47},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":48},{"type":"charslot","id":49},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":50},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":51},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":52},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowfall","volume":"1","id":53},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":54},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_283_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"救援队员","text":"这里，这里还有一个活着的！","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_npc_283_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"喂——撑住了！是个谢拉格人就给我咬着牙挺住了，别睡着！","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":59},{"type":"charslot","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"受伤的男人","text":"腿，我的腿......","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"受伤的男人","text":"我的腿动不了，我的腿已经......呃！","id":62},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"别动！后面的，情况看清楚了没，到底怎么样？！","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_283_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"救援队员","text":"挖开了，雪洞已经挖开了！但是他的腿被钢筋压住了，如果这玩意儿没断就只能找医生来......不对，先别急，我再挖开一点试试！","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_npc_283_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":67},{"type":"charslot","id":68},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_brnchflsnw","volume":"0.8","id":69},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":70},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":71},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_283_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"救援队员","text":"呼——嘿！呼......好消息，这钢筋已经完全断了，我们只要能抬起来就行！","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_npc_283_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"出力气能办好的事儿都不用担心，都过来，搭把手！","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"multiline","name":"阿克托斯","text":"抓稳了，一、二、三","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":77},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_scratchmetalwall","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"sc","id":78},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sc","fadetime":"1.5","id":79},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"12","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":80},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":81},{"type":"multiline","name":"阿克托斯","text":"——喝啊！","id":82},{"type":"dialog","id":83},{"type":"charslot","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"受伤的男人","text":"痛、呃啊啊......好痛......","id":85},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"好了，有空当了，把他拖出来！尽快！","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_283_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"救援队员","text":"我拉住他了，轻一点，把他的身体抬起来，用布垫在底下，对，小心，别扯到他的伤口......","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_npc_283_1$1.png"},{"type":"multiline","name":"救援队员","text":"就这样慢慢地拖出来——","id":90},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothtrailground","volume":"1","id":91},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":92},{"type":"multiline","name":"救援队员","text":"好！成了！担架，快点把担架弄过来！","id":93},{"type":"dialog","id":94},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_501_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":95},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_kneelsnow_s","volume":"1","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"罗德岛医疗干员","text":"让一让，让一让，担架到了！","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_501_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":98},{"type":"charslot","id":99},{"type":"text","text":"压抑着的、克制着的呼唤。救援。担架。生还者。","id":100},{"type":"text","text":"白茫茫的雪地之上，无数人忙碌地奔跑着，脸颊滚烫，甚至溢出汗水。","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"古罗，这边暂时交给你。看好了，能救活的一个也别放弃。","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_260_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":104},{"type":"multiline","name":"古罗","text":"明白！","id":105},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_260_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":106},{"type":"multiline","name":"古罗","text":"但......您要去哪儿？","id":107},{"type":"dialog","id":108},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":109},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":110},{"type":"charslot","id":111},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":112},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_199_yak_1#4$1","id":113},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_254_1#1$1","id":114},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":115},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":116},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_199_yak_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"阿克托斯老爷......南侧的救援难道已经结束了？","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_254_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"没，还没结束。","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"古罗在看着，我是来找你的。","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_199_yak_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"我们这里还算顺利，您不用担心。布朗陶的增援也到了，带来了不少毛毯和食物。","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"菈塔托丝夫人本想亲自过来的，但似乎实在是分不开身。","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_254_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"......算了，想来也是。","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_254_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"大家心里有数，没人会因为这个怪她的。","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_254_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"*谢拉格俚语*，怎么就碰上了这么场灾！","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_199_yak_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"这次雪崩来得太突然了，没有一点征兆，我们所有人都没有预备。","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ec/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_254_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"对，就是这个，我要找你说的就是这个事儿！","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"你知道谢拉格的规矩，这雪崩发生的地方在佩尔罗契家的领地，我们负责照看领地内的雪山。","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"我们一直在记录积雪的厚度，那记录我看了好几次，明明一切正常！","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_254_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"所以我才来问你，你们那个什么研究院里不是还有人专门跑去看雪山的吗？那些人怎么说？","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_199_yak_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"研究院......您说莱茵生命？","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_254_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"是啊，他们天天在山上跑来跑去的，鼓捣什么高科技装备，总不能一点发现都没有吧？","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_199_yak_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"按理来说应该是有的。但他们也有自己的任务，未必会把所有精力都放在研究雪山上。","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"而且雪崩发生后我们立刻就赶过来了，他们到底有没有发现什么我也并不确定。","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"恩希欧迪斯老爷也派了锏小姐带领队伍上山调查，估计很快就能回来了。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_254_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"嗯......","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_254_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"啧，总觉得后背发凉，这场雪崩到底是什么毛病......","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":152},{"type":"dialog","id":153},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.7","id":154},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowstormflp","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"s","id":155},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"s","fadetime":"2","id":156},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":157},{"type":"text","text":"山风夹杂着雪花，呼啸而来。小山一般高大的男人回头，他站在山脚下，沉默的山峰将他比较得如同一颗小石。","id":158},{"type":"dialog","id":159},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"s","fadetime":"1","id":160},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"那是......","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":163},{"type":"charslot","id":164},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":165,"musicid":1},{"type":"text","text":"跌落的雪铺成一片白色，一行人正从山路上快速下撤。几步就到了二人近前。","id":166},{"type":"dialog","id":167},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowrun","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"b","id":168},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"b","fadetime":"2","id":169},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_277_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":170},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_277_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"调查队员","text":"角峰大人！","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_277_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"调查队员","text":"我们得尽快通知恩希欧迪斯老爷！山上，山上发现——","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_277_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":175},{"type":"charslot","id":176},{"type":"text","text":"调查队员脸色发白，他的毛靴底部，被踩污的雪凝成一片湿润而冰冷的灰色。","id":177},{"type":"text","text":"因为奔跑而急促的呼吸夹杂在风中，凝聚成一股令人不安的呜咽。","id":178},{"type":"dialog","id":179},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":180},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":181},{"type":"charslot","id":182},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":183},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":184},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":185},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"对于框架协议，各位代表没有别的问题了，那么我们接下来开始讨论协议细则。","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"首先是第一项，关于谢拉格与卡西米尔的联合矿场的税务——","id":188},{"type":"dialog","id":189},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","id":190},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"喀兰贸易文员","text":"（小声）董事长，锏小姐有要事通报，正在门外等待。","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"......现在？","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"喀兰贸易文员","text":"（小声）是，她说......非常紧急。","id":194},{"type":"dialog","id":195},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":196},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":197},{"type":"charslot","id":198},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_bg_45_g11_karlanheadquarters.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#1$1","id":200},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1#1$1","id":201},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":202},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":203},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"紧急的事？","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锏","text":"调查队在雪崩发生处的山上发现了这个。","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_4116_blkkgt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":209},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":210},{"type":"text","text":"锏伸出手，她戴着手套，一小片漆黑的源石碎片静静地躺在她的手中。","id":211},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"......在谢拉格的山上？","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锏","text":"如果火车站旁边那座雪山还算谢拉格境内的话，没错。","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_4116_blkkgt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锏","text":"诺希斯和罗德岛的人都看过了，基本可以确认......","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_4116_blkkgt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":217},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":218},{"type":"text","text":"锏环顾四周，确认没有第三个人后，才压低声音说道。","id":219},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锏","text":"这场雪崩，就是天灾。","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4116_blkkgt_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"......","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"有多少人知道？","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锏","text":"调查队是我们的人，姑且还能控制，但是山下已经发现了不少感染的人。","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_4116_blkkgt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锏","text":"消息瞒不住太久。","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_4116_blkkgt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"......","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"通知角峰，立刻封锁受灾现场，不要让运送货物的民众靠近。山上也要设置关口。","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"联系罗德岛，请他们对感染者的收治一定注意保密，需要什么帮助都可以联系喀兰贸易。","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"再帮我转告菈塔托丝和阿克托斯，一个小时后在受灾的火车站见面，请他们务必要赶到。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锏","text":"好。还有别的吗？","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_4116_blkkgt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"......你带足人手，立刻去蔓珠院。","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"同样......让诺希斯带人，去保护莱茵生命观测站。","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锏","text":"了解。","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_4116_blkkgt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":243},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":244},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","focus":"r","id":246},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.6","id":247},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":248},{"type":"dialog","id":249},{"type":"charslot","id":250},{"type":"text","text":"恩希欧迪斯理了理衣装，转身走进了会议室。","id":251},{"type":"dialog","id":252},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":253},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":254},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":255},{"type":"charslot","id":256},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":257},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":258},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorclosequite","volume":"1","id":259},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":260},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"抱歉各位，耽误了一点时间，让我们继续吧。","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"首先是第一项，关于谢拉格与卡西米尔的联合矿场的税务......","id":263},{"type":"dialog","id":264},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":265},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":266},{"type":"charslot","id":267},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_bg_24_g3_mainhall.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":268},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":269},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loading_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_sys_loading_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":270,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":271},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":272},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_174_slbell_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"......","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":275},{"type":"charslot","id":276},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_268","focus":"l","id":277},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2014_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年长的修士","text":"荒唐......荒唐！","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_268.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年长的修士","text":"所有的典籍都未记载过这样的预言。耶拉冈德怎么会用天灾来惩罚我们？这根本就是无稽之谈！","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_268.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2014_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的修士","text":"可它已经发生了！祂已经因为愤怒，离我们而去了！","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的修士","text":"如果不是耶拉冈德的怒火，我们又要如何解释现在发生的这场天灾？","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的修士","text":"看看此时此刻围在蔓珠院外的人们吧，他们都是耶拉冈德虔诚的信徒，是谢拉格善良的子民。","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的修士","text":"难道我们要告诉他们，你们失去的亲人，你们遭受的苦难......全都是无妄之灾？","id":285},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_268","focus":"l","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年长的修士","text":"如今人心已经乱作一团，动摇信仰的声音不绝于耳......可越是如此，我们的信念越是要坚定。","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_268.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年长的修士","text":"我们怎知这不是耶拉冈德施予我们的考验，只是让我们信念坚定的考验？","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_268.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年长的修士","text":"耶拉冈德没有舍弃谢拉格......耶拉冈德怎会无故惩罚谢拉格？","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_268.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2014_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的修士","text":"难道不是我们做了忤逆耶拉冈德的事，这才——","id":291},{"type":"dialog","id":292},{"type":"charslot","id":293},{"type":"text","text":"年轻修士看了看坐在大殿中央的圣女，又悻悻低下头去，不发一言。","id":294},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_174_slbell_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"不必顾虑，畅所欲言即可。","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":297},{"type":"charslot","id":298},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2014_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的修士","text":"圣女大人......","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的修士","text":"我认为，这是耶拉冈德的怒火，这是......这是警示......","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的修士","text":"也许正是因为蔓珠院......因为我们做了错的决定。","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的修士","text":"也许我们就不该同意那些无信仰之人在圣山上大兴土木，我们应该坚持，坚持拒绝......","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的修士","text":"如果不是那些人亵渎了耶拉冈德的圣殿——使祂发怒，谢拉格又怎么会......","id":304},{"type":"dialog","id":305},{"type":"charslot","id":306},{"type":"text","text":"他的声音越来越低，声音中的颤抖却越来越少。整座大殿也跟着安静下来，无人出声反驳。","id":307},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_174_slbell_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"我明白了。","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"您认为，是我作为圣女做出了冒犯耶拉冈德的决定，这才为谢拉格招致了这场天灾。","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2014_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的修士","text":"不、不是......圣女大人，我的意思是......","id":312},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_174_slbell_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"不，你的观点很有参考意义——如今不只是山下的信众，还有和我一同坐在这里的诸位，其中应该有不少人都怀抱着与你一样的想法。","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_174_slbell_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"这就是如今的情况，人们对蔓珠院产生怀疑，而各位也心怀忐忑与摇摆。","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_174_slbell_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"方戈修士还有罗纳亚修士，你们一个认为耶拉冈德仍如旧日一般眷顾我们，神恩永济；而另一个认为耶拉冈德已然......","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":319},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":320},{"type":"text","text":"少女垂下头思考片刻。洁白的脸上几乎如同冰面一般平静。","id":321},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_174_slbell_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"就请两位向我背诵，《耶拉冈德》中提及的三次“守护”吧。","id":323,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":324},{"type":"charslot","id":325},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_268","focus":"all","id":326},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2014_1#1$1","focus":"all","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"两位修士","text":"......是，圣女大人。","id":328},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2014_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的修士","text":"第一处守护，《耶拉冈德》，第七页第九行。","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的修士","text":"“于是祂对身边的牧童说——”","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的修士","text":"“我将是你们的庇佑，我将是你们的依靠。”","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的修士","text":"“我会在林中狩猎，我将在土地中播种，让你们有皮子穿有东西吃，不至于冻死与饿死。”","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的修士","text":"“这正是祂守护我们不被寒风与饥肠辘辘侵害的时候。”","id":334},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_268","focus":"l","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年长的修士","text":"第二处守护，《耶拉冈德》，第二十五页第十七行。","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_268.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年长的修士","text":"“所以守护者在人群中诞生了，他们在七彩的云霞之中苏醒，以雪水浇灌的泥土构建高墙。”","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_268.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年长的修士","text":"“这正是祂守护我们的家宅与亲眷的时刻，赐予我们抵御外来之敌的技巧。”","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_268.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2014_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的修士","text":"以及......《耶拉冈德》，第三十九页第二行。最后一处提及。","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的修士","text":"“那一日，祂在人群之中宣讲。”","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的修士","text":"“我的眼睛会看护你们，我的皮毛会温暖你们，我的脊骨会守护你们，我的血肉将成为对你们的赐福。”","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的修士","text":"“你们已经知晓风雪的道理，了解行走的姿态。”","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的修士","text":"“你们已是谢拉格的谢拉格人，这谢拉格的土地从此彻彻底底地......交到了谢拉格人的手上。”","id":344},{"type":"dialog","id":345},{"type":"charslot","id":346},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_174_slbell_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"很好......","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"那么请各位回答我，《耶拉冈德》可有一句提及，耶拉冈德会保护谢拉格永远不受天灾侵害吗？","id":349,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"难道各位，是在代替耶拉冈德向祂的子民许诺吗？","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":351},{"type":"charslot","id":352},{"type":"text","text":"满座之中，不少修士低下头去不再言语。","id":353},{"type":"text","text":"寂静得落针可闻。焚香的气息萦绕在每一个人鼻尖，却让他们觉得连呼吸都凝滞在如今的谈话中。","id":354},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蔓珠院长老","text":"......圣女大人，言之有理。","id":356},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蔓珠院长老","text":"天灾降临在了谢拉格，有人因此而死，更多人因此染病。","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蔓珠院长老","text":"如今这个消息已经传遍了整个雪境。恐惧、不安、进一步的悲伤甚至于愤怒，这些东西正在谢拉格人身上流淌。","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蔓珠院长老","text":"我们要做的是为此寻找解决之法。","id":360},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_174_slbell_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"这是自然。现在不是我们争辩的时候。我所说的这些话也正是为了警示各位，不可陷入慌乱与偏执。","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"在座的各位，都是耶拉冈德的信徒，应当知晓言语的分量。从现在开始，蔓珠院众人不得再妄言耶拉冈德的惩罚。","id":363,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"从明天开始，我会进入藏经阁，全心解经，倾听祂的声音。","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"阿德颂长老。","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"在。","id":367},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_174_slbell_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"现在你已经接任大长老之位，我闭关期间，蔓珠院事务一应由你代理。","id":369,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"安抚信众，执行悼丧仪式，抄写赈灾慰灵的经文，一应事务不可落下。都要尽心尽力，诚恳而行。","id":370,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1998_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿德颂","text":"是......","id":372},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_174_slbell_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"我们应该相信......","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_174_slbell_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"......谢拉格曾经经历过无数风雪与难关，蔓珠院会永远与耶拉冈德的子民同在。","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":377},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":378},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":379},{"type":"charslot","id":380},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_bg_24_g4_boudoir.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":381},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":382},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":383},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":384},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_174_slbell_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"呼......","id":386,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_174_slbell_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"还好，总算没出太大的乱子......","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_174_slbell_1#11$1","focus":"n","id":389},{"type":"text","text":"少女深深地呼出一口气，伏倒在桌案上，一直以来挺直如同雪中松柏的腰背终于卸力松垮下去。","id":390},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_174_slbell_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"我真不明白，为什么人们总是会将神明当作许愿机呢？为什么要将世上的一切幸运与不幸都归咎到神明身上呢？","id":392,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"我知道，作为圣女是不该这样想，可是......","id":393,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"可是我也不明白，为什么偏偏在这个时候会有天灾发生......","id":394,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_174_slbell_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"呼......","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/16/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_174_slbell_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"雅儿，还是叫换衣的侍从们进来吧。","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"multiline","name":"恩雅","text":"丧礼仪式已经备好，从明日开始，我们就......","id":399},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":400},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_174_slbell_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":401},{"type":"multiline","name":"恩雅","text":"雅儿？","id":402},{"type":"dialog","id":403},{"type":"charslot","id":404},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drtywndblw","volume":"0.8","id":405},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodcracle","volume":"0.6","loop":"true","channel":"a","id":406},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":407},{"type":"text","text":"呼唤声落下，房间中依旧寂静，唯有风声与火声交织。","id":408},{"type":"text","text":"恩雅回过头，她这才发现房间内空无一人。","id":409},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_174_slbell_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"雅儿......你在吗？","id":411,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_174_slbell_1#5$1","focus":"n","id":412},{"type":"text","text":"原本应该时常陪伴在圣女身旁的侍女长消失无踪，只有恩雅一个人的影子被火光拖得又细又长，在昏暗的房间里不断闪烁跳跃。","id":413},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_174_slbell_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"雅儿......？","id":415,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":416},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":417},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":418},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.3","fadetime":"2","channel":"a","id":419},{"type":"bg","duration":"1.5","from":"0","to":"1","block":"true","id":420},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"0.8","block":"true","id":421},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大长老","text":"恩雅......","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大长老","text":"你......诚实地告诉我......","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大长老","text":"你还能......听到耶拉冈德的声音吗？","id":425},{"type":"dialog","id":426},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"1.5","keep":"true","initamount":"0.7","amount":"0","block":"true","id":427},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"2","channel":"a","id":428},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":429},{"type":"bg","duration":"1.5","from":"1","to":"0","block":"true","id":430},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":431},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_monastery_nomal.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":432,"musicid":3},{"type":"image","image":"67_i03","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.3","yScale":"1.3","x":"-180","y":"50","fadetime":"2.5","id":433},{"type":"imagetween","xFrom":"-180","yFrom":"50","xTo":"0","yTo":"0","xScaleFrom":"1.3","yScaleFrom":"1.3","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"25","block":"false","id":434},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":435},{"type":"text","text":"柴火燃烧的噼啪声在空荡荡的房间内回响。","id":436},{"type":"text","text":"窗外的风依旧呼啸，似乎可以听见圣山之下，迷茫的信众嚎哭的声音。","id":437},{"type":"text","text":"恩雅还记得初次来到这间属于圣女的房间时的感受。","id":438},{"type":"text","text":"陌生的房间，不一样的气味，目所能及却再也不能以自己的名字返回的家，那时候的她也一样觉得这间房空荡如同雪洞。","id":439},{"type":"text","text":"但是她已经习惯了有一个人在这里陪伴自己。有一个人可以让自己毫无顾虑地倾诉心事，可以让自己有所依赖。","id":440},{"type":"text","text":"但此时......","id":441},{"type":"text","text":"翻阅到一半的《耶拉冈德》古老的卷轴铺在桌面上，梳妆镜里映出少女茫然无措的脸。","id":442},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"雅儿......","id":443},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"......你明明答应过我，不会忽然被带走的。","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"到底......到底发生了什么......","id":445},{"type":"dialog","id":446},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":447},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":448},{"type":"charslot","id":449},{"type":"image","id":450}],"characters":["角峰","救援队员A","救援队员B","众救援队员","救援队员","阿克托斯","受伤的男人","罗德岛医疗干员","调查队员","恩希欧迪斯","喀兰贸易文员","锏","恩雅","年长的修士","激动的修士","两位修士","蔓珠院长老","阿德颂","大长老"]}